: Unable to access jarfile /deployments/target/quarkus-run.jar\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n(Describe the expected behavior clearly and concisely.)\r\nThe Quarkus pod(mutable jar) runs well without\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\n(Describe the actual behavior clearly and concisely.)\r\nPod is CrashLoopBackOff with an Error: Unable to access jarfile /deployments/target/quarkus-run.jar\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\nLink to a small reproducer (preferably a Maven project if the issue is not Gradle-specific).\r\n\r\nOr attach an archive containing the reproducer to the issue.\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Use a getting-started project like helloword\r\n2. Add an quarkus-openshift extension\r\n3. Add the below configurations\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\n```properties\r\n# Add your application.properties here, if applicable.\r\nquarkus.package.type=mutable-jar\r\nquarkus.container-image.build=true\r\nquarkus.kubernetes-client.trust-certs=true\r\nquarkus.kubernetes.deployment-target=openshift\r\nquarkus.kubernetes.deploy=true\r\nquarkus.openshift.expose=true\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n(If applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14066977/100880077-50bab580-347a-11eb-9a06-392d2038082c.png)\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: \r\n - Output of `java -version`: OpenJDK 11\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.10.2.Final\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): apache-maven-3.6.3\r\n - OpenShift: 4.6.3\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n(Add any other context about the problem here.)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"